E18-S3|E18|Prod app bundle built against the live API|build|E18-S2,E15-S4,E16-S1|0.5|flutter build appbundle runs with the prod flavor and the Cognito and FLAVOR dart-defines pointing at https://api.okuvu.in and exits 0; aapt2 reports package ai.okuvu.app with targetSdk 36; the bundle size and SHA-256 are recorded
